; Regression test for issue #693: optimized builds crashed whenever an
; exception was thrown.
;
; Each case below throws from a different depth and must end with an
; error message and exit status 1, never a signal.  The Nix flake's
; check phase runs the suite against a Release build, which is where
; these cases matter most.

2024/01/01 Test transaction
    Expenses:Test    $100
    Assets:Cash

; Thrown while opening the journal.
test bal -f /nonexistent/file.dat -> 1
__ERROR__
Error: Cannot read journal file "/nonexistent/file.dat"
end test

; Thrown while processing arguments.
test bal --invalid-option -> 1
__ERROR__
Error: Illegal option --invalid-option
end test

; Thrown deep in report evaluation, then caught and rethrown by three
; layers that each add context on the way out to main().
test reg -d 'amount > "abc"' -> 1
__ERROR__
While evaluating value expression:
  (amount > "abc")
  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
While comparing if abc is less than $100:
While handling posting from "$FILE", line 10:
>     Expenses:Test    $100
Error: Cannot compare a string to an amount
end test
